source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: An effect delimiter is not a word rune, so a Monospace Span nests inside a bold effect.
-- input.jira --
*{{a}}*
-- rendered.html --
<p><b><tt>a</tt></b></p>
-- want.md --
**`a`**
